                <pb facs="0481" n="371" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg371"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.00/1385: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Herrick</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1928-03-14T15:10:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1928-03-07T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>].<lb/>[Received March 14, 1928—3:10
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>67. Foreign Office informs me that four-power Tangier conversations will begin at
                    Quai d’Orsay on March 20th. See my despatch No. 8400 of March 6.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herrick</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
